title: "GaDRA: Gated Dual-conditioned Residual Adapter"
abstract: >-
  A HuggingFace peft-native implementation of GaDRA, a parameter-efficient
  adapter with a per-token, input-conditioned residual gate that learns when
  not to apply the LoRA update.
